        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185269030?u=1fc22565ccf4566b6f734fabaa87e03d9a31cfe4&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Removes the incorrect <code class=\"notranslate\">media</code> attribute entry from the <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;meta name=\"color-scheme\"&gt;</code> documentation.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The <code class=\"notranslate\">media</code> attribute is only relevant for <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;meta name=\"theme-color\"&gt;</code>, as documented on the main <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;meta&gt;</code> page. It was mistakenly also listed as a valid additional attribute for <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;meta name=\"color-scheme\"&gt;</code>, likely copied over by mistake in a previous PR. This fix removes the incorrect mention so readers aren't misled into thinking <code class=\"notranslate\">media</code> has an effect on <code class=\"notranslate\">color-scheme</code>.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #43091.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3925502605\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43091\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43091/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43091\">#43091</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45202",
            "title": "Remove invalid `media` attribute from `<meta name=\"color-scheme\">` docs",
            "date_modified": "2026-08-17T22:53:29.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-08-17T21:24:04.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "BHUVANSH855",
                "url": "https://github.com/BHUVANSH855"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23019147?u=4c0de81596ced64dc067dea5686f7ca2912db0cb&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Adds pages for the following command and events of the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/WebDriver/Reference/BiDi/Modules/script\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">script</code> module</a>:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">script.getRealms</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">script.realmCreated</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">script.realmDestroyed</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Adds sections to the <code class=\"notranslate\">script</code> module landing page to explain realms and sandbox realms in the context of BiDi.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Makes two passing fixes to <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/WebDriver/Reference/BiDi/Modules/log/entryAdded\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">log.entryadded</code></a> to update a link and to remove the other.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Spec links</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/webdriver-bidi/#command-script-getRealms\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://w3c.github.io/webdriver-bidi/#command-script-getRealms</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/webdriver-bidi/#event-script-realmCreated\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://w3c.github.io/webdriver-bidi/#event-script-realmCreated</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/webdriver-bidi/#event-script-realmDestroyed\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://w3c.github.io/webdriver-bidi/#event-script-realmDestroyed</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issue</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Doc issue: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5013788640\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/mdn/issues/851\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/mdn/issues/851/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/mdn/issues/851\">mdn/mdn#851</a></p>",
