        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/100893747?u=3b97bcf8df2ce85c97303fae453ca037fb277756&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Fix a grammar issue in the Adobe Illustrator section of the SVG tools tutorial by removing an unnecessary comma before \"that\".</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This improves the grammar and readability of the documentation for MDN readers.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">No functional or technical changes were made. This PR only updates the wording of the existing documentation.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>",
